# ==============================================================================
# Evelyn Engine REST Client Scratchpad
# For use with the 'humao.rest-client' VS Code extension.
# Note: Variables automatically read EVELYN_API_KEY from .env if defined.
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7860
@apiKey = {{$dotenv EVELYN_API_KEY}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Health, Runtime Status & Identity
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Server Health, Models & Downstream Service Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Dynamic Engine Identity & Persona Specs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/identity
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Ambient Thought Bubble Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/thought_bubble
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Background Heavy Tasks & Maintenance
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Active Heavy Tasks & Queue States
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heavy_tasks
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Master Librarian Maintenance Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/librarian/status
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Knowledge Review, Procedures & Proposals
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Unified Review Dashboard (Proposals, Procedures & Extractions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/review/unified
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pending Fact / Memory Proposals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/review/proposals
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Operational Procedures Index
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/procedures
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Pending Terminal Agent Command Approvals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/terminal/pending
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Vault Domains & File Count Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vault/domains
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Engine Telemetry & Deep Research
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### LLM Thinking & Reasoning Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/telemetry/thinking
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ChromaDB RAG Retrieval & Keyword Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/telemetry/rag
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Deep Research Active & Historic Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/research/list
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Chat History & Conversational Execution
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Recent Conversation History (Latest 5 Messages)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Active Assistant Streaming Session State
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/active_stream
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Submit Conversational Turn (POST /chat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "message": "Status ping: confirm engine operational.",
    "think": "low"
}

### Abort In-Flight Generation Turn
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stop
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{}

### Upload Document / Code Attachment for Chat Turn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/upload
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.py"
Content-Type: text/x-python

def hello():
    return "Hello from Evelyn chat attachment!"

--boundary--
